# Plan E PoC (trustAccess) Implementation Plan

> **For agentic workers:** REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use superpowers:subagent-driven-development (recommended) or superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan task-by-task. Steps use checkbox (`- [ ]`) syntax for tracking.

**Goal:** 用 trustAccess 一個群組,驗證 Plan E 的核心機制 —— in-master 與 framework AgentX subagent **併存註冊同一顆 iss_build==0 OID**,in-master 贏 wire(SET 留 in-master 原生原子),GET 由 in-master 前送到 framework(快)。**只驗機制**,forward 閘門(list vs flag)PoC 過後再定。

